    {
      "id": "e1a1a1a1-0014-4a11-9a11-000000000011",
      "name": "Faithfulness Judge",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are evaluating faithfulness using the RAGAS methodology: decompose the system's answer into distinct atomic factual claims, then judge whether EACH claim is directly supported by the retrieved context. This is claim-level grounding checking, not a holistic 1-5 rating.\n\nSystem's actual answer:\n{{ $('Combine Retrieved Context').item.json.actual_answer }}\n\nRetrieved documentation context (what the system's RAG retriever actually found for this question):\n{{ $('Combine Retrieved Context').item.json.retrieved_context }}\n\nSteps:\n1. Break the answer into a list of distinct, atomic factual claims (a claim that combines two facts should be split into two claims).\n2. For each claim, judge: is it directly supported/entailed by the retrieved context above (true), or not supported / contradicted / absent from the context (false)?\n\nThis is independent of whether the answer is a good answer to the question or matches any external ground truth - only check whether each claim is grounded in the retrieved context provided above.\n\nReturn ONLY JSON: {\"claims\": [{\"claim\": \"<claim text>\", \"supported\": true|false}, ...]}. If the answer makes no factual claims (e.g. it's a pure refusal), return {\"claims\": []}.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {}
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 5,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "e1a1a1a1-0015-4a11-9a11-000000000012",
      "name": "Faithfulness Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"claims\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"claim\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"supported\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}}, \"required\": [\"claim\", \"supported\"]}}}, \"required\": [\"claims\"]}",
        "autoFix": false
